<title>USA: Fortune represents 63 pct of American stock.</title>
<headline>Fortune represents 63 pct of American stock.</headline>
<dateline>OLD GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fortune Brands Inc said on Tuesday that it had allocated 63.18 percent of each shareholder's tax basis in American Brands common stock to Fortune Brands common stock, and 36.82 percent to Gallaher Group Plc shares.</p>
<p>The allocation, made for tax reasons, follows American Brands' spinoff  of Gallaher, its internatinal tobacco operations, in late May.</p>
<p>American Brands also changed its name to Fortune Brands in connection with the spinoff.</p>
</text>
